"Event Day Registration | Movemint (https://docs.movemint.cc/organizers/pre-race-event-day/event-day-registration)\nciteturn9search0 [wordlim: 200] Published: 4 months ago; Crawled: last month; Organizers Pre-race & Event Day ... Continue reading how to use Movemint's Event Day Registration tool as well as alternative ways to add participants on the day-of the event if paying with alternative payment methods.\n\nOrganizersPre-race & Event Day\n\n# Event Day Registration\n\nCollecting registrations on event day\n\nUpdated Jul 10, 2026|2 min read\n\nCopy page\n\n## About Event Day Registration\n\nEvent Day Registration is a tool you can use to help participants sign-up for your event after online registration as closed. This will tool is designed to be managed by a Full Admin or race-director-assistant at the event.\n\nContinue reading how to use Movemint's Event Day Registration tool as well as alternative ways to add participants on the day-of the event if paying with alternative payment methods.\n\n## Registration with Event Day Registration\n\n#### Select the Event Day Registration option in Event Admin\n\nClick on the Event Day Registration option under the tab in ...\n\nImage\n\n#### Athlete inputs participant information and pays for registration.\n\nHave the athlete fill out their information with the registration process and pay for their registration at the end.\n\nImage\n\nParticipant Details Process\n\n#### Assign bib number to newly registered participant\n\nIf automatic bib assignment is enabled, the registered participant will automatically be assigned a bib number. However, if not, dynamic bib numbers can be assigned from a stack of bibs and inputted in check-in from the crm.\n\n#### Check-In newly registered participant\n\nThe newly registered participant will be added to the crm and can now be checked in.\n\nNote: Participants registering through this method will be paying the day-of registration price configured by the sub-events.\n\n### Other Considerations for Event Day Registration\n\n#### CRM (Add Entity)\n\nIf the participant is paying for on-site registration outside of credit card such as cash or check, they can be added as an event participant through the #add-entity button in the crm.\n\nImage\n\nEvent Participant option from the Add Entity button\n\nNote: Not all information is needed to add an event participant this way. Necessary information up to the event organizer and timer can be collected. Waivers are also not acknowledge when adding a participant.\n\n#### Event Page (Register)\n\nEvents can re-open event registration during the check-in window during the event, allowing participants to sign up and pay for registration with their phone.\n\nIf automatic bib assignment is enabled, the registered participant will automatically be assigned a bib number. However, if not, dynamic bib numbers can be assigned from a stack of bibs and inputted in check-in from the crm.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nBib Assignment | Movemint (https://docs.movemint.cc/organizers/pre-race-event-day/bib-assignment)\nciteturn9search1 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 months ago; Organizers Pre-race & Event Day ... Movemint’s bib assignment feature makes it easy to manage and assign bib numbers. ... #### Bib Assignment for Event Day Registration\n\nOrganizersPre-race & Event Day\n\n# Bib Assignment\n\nManage bib number assignments for participants.\n\nUpdated Jul 10, 2026|1 min read\n\nCopy page\n\nMovemint’s bib assignment feature makes it easy to manage and assign bib numbers. With automated options and real-time syncing, organizers can ensure accurate, efficient distribution and a smooth race-day experience.\n\n## How to Assign Bib Numbers\n\n### Manage Bib Numbers\n\nStart by setting the starting and ending bib numbers.\n\nImage\n\nThen set for either all or specific sub-events and by all or specific genders.\n\nImage\n\n### Assign Bib Numbers\n\n#### Auto Assign\n\nParticipants are automatically assigned a bib number as they register (for all or specific sub-events).\n\nImage\n\n#### Bulk Assign\n\nThis assigns bib numbers to existing participants all at once. Bib numbers can be ordered by Last Name, First Name, or Registration Date by all Sub Events or for specific Sub Events.\n\nImage\n\n### See Bib Assignment\n\nHead over to crm to see participants with bib numbers assigned.\n\n### Other Considerations\n\n#### Destroy All Bib Assignments\n\nImage\n\nClicking this button will delete all of the bib assignment ranges and unassigns them from participants. However, any manually assigned bib numbers through the CRM will remain.\n\n#### Reset All Bib Assignments\n\nImage\n\nClicking this button will unassign bib numbers from participants that have been bulk assigned by bib ranges. However, any manually assigned bib numbers through the CRM will remain.\n\n#### Bib Assignment for Event Day Registration\n\nYou can also assign bib numbers for athletes who register on the day of the event in the CRM if there is no auto-assignment. Refer to event-day-registration for more details on registering a participant and assigning their bib number on the day of the event.--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nOff Course — 404 (https://docs.movemint.cc/organizer-dashboard/events/event-admin/race-day/event-day-registration)\nciteturn9search2 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: 2 months ago; `/organizer-dashboard/events/event-admin/race-day/event-day-registration`\n404\n\n# Looks like you're off course!\n\nThis page has either moved, been deleted, or never existed in the first place.\n\n`/organizer-dashboard/events/event-admin/race-day/event-day-registration`\n\nGo backHome\n\nTip: If you followed a link here, the content may have been reorganized. Try searching from the homepage.\n"
